  "tips": [
    "Item tiles have levels. Stepping on one gives 1 XP. The XP needed is Level 2: 2, Level 3: 3, Level 4: 7, Level 5: 15.",
    "The Starting tile gives 2 random Item tiles +1 XP, whether you stop on it or pass it.",
    "You can keep some basic dice after the event by not claiming the Odyssey of Adventure chests and leaving the mail unclaimed until the end.",
    "There are 7 daily Adventure Resource packs. You must buy the previous level to buy the next. Levels 1 to 6 are once a day and level 7 is 5 times a day.",
    "If you are a low spender, the Treasure Hunt Tome can be worth it if you pick Design Plans or Charm Designs in the Adventure Caravan.",
    "Check other events running at the same time to share points."
  ]
